{
  "_readme": [
    "Per-song metadata, keyed by the stem directory name under ~/Music/karaoke/htdemucs.",
    "Created 29 Aug 2026. Before this file the displayed title WAS the directory name with",
    "underscores swapped (prepare-web.sh), so a typo in a request became the title forever.",
    "",
    "prepare-web.sh merges this into songs.json. A directory with no entry here still",
    "publishes - it just falls back to the old underscore-swapped name.",
    "",
    "Drafted by Claude from the song names alone and NOT verified against the audio.",
    "Where the song was ambiguous or unknown, film/singers are left EMPTY rather than",
    "guessed - an empty field is a to-do, a wrong field is a lie on a screen at a party.",
    "",
    "  title   - what the player shows. Fix typos here, never by renaming the directory:",
    "            the directory name is the key for stems, lyrics and the request queue.",
    "  film    - film or album. Empty string means unknown, not 'no film'.",
    "  singers - list. Empty list means unknown.",
    "  year    - null when unknown.",
    "  hide    - true removes it from the player without deleting the stems. Used for",
    "            duplicates.",
    "  alias   - for a duplicate: the directory this is a duplicate OF. Documentation only."
  ],
